# The frontend calls the backend using same-origin relative URLs (/api, /r,
# /track) by default, so it needs NO configuration in the default setup:
#   - dev:  Vite proxies these to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts)
#   - prod: FastAPI serves the built SPA, so they are already same-origin.
#
# Only set this if the frontend is deployed SEPARATELY from the backend
# (e.g. this app on Vercel, the API on Railway/Render) — point it at the
# backend's public origin, no trailing slash. Leave unset otherwise.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.up.railway.app
